escription_en": "Pugna can cast spells and use items while channeling.\n\nPugna receives %tower_scale%%% spell amplification per destroyed tower.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["tower_scale", "spell_amp_tooltip"]}, {"subject": "pugna_life_drain", "name_zh": "帕格纳·生命汲取", "name_en": "Life Drain", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 使用生命汲取时，帕格纳吸取目标敌方单位的生命值，并获得其视野。\n\n向队友施放可以将自己的生命值转移给队友。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - When cast on an enemy, Pugna drains health from the target enemy unit to heal himself and granting vision over the target.\n\nWhen cast on an ally, Pugna will drain his own health into his ally.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "冷却时间减少%abilitycooldown%秒。以敌方英雄为目标时，帕格纳每秒降低他们%spell_amp_drain_rate%%%技能伤害输出，最高可达到%spell_amp_drain_max%%%，并且自身的技能伤害输出提升，最高可达到%max_spell_amp_drain_pct%%%。魔晶升级下对幽冥守卫施放时降低和提升的速率为%spell_amp_drain_rate_ward%%%。负面效果持续%spell_amp_drain_duration%秒。", "en": "Reduces cooldown by %abilitycooldown%s. When targeting an enemy hero, Pugna reduces their outgoing spell damage by %spell_amp_drain_rate%%% per second up to a maximum of %spell_amp_drain_max%%% and increases his own, up to a maximum of %max_spell_amp_drain_pct%%%. When draining through a Nether Ward using Shard, the rate of increase/decrease is %spell_amp_drain_rate_ward%%% instead. Debuff lasts %spell_amp_drain_duration% seconds."}, "shard": {"zh": "生命汲取可以对幽冥守卫施放，使生命汲取可以折射至守卫附近%abilitycastrange%范围内所有敌方英雄，造成%shard_damage_pct_from_ward%%%效果。守卫被摧毁后效果将会中断。", "en": "Life Drain can target your Nether Ward, causing life drain to refract to all enemy heroes within %abilitycastrange% units of the ward for %shard_damage_pct_from_ward%%% of its normal value. The effect is interrupted if the ward is destroyed."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["health_drain", "ally_healing", "tick_rate", "drain_buffer", "shard_damage_pct_from_ward", "bonus_heal_pct", "spell_amp_drain_rate", "spell_amp_drain_max", "spell_amp_drain_rate_ward", "spell_amp_drain_duration", "max_spell_amp_drain_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "templar_assassin_refraction", "name_zh": "圣堂刺客·折光", "name_en": "Refraction", "description_zh": "圣堂刺客变得高度难以捉摸，获得一个小型护盾，同时获得攻击力加成。攻击力加成和护盾效果相互独立，并且都是有限次数的效果。如果护盾被摧毁，只要还有能量点数就会再产生一个新的。如果单次伤害超过了剩余的护盾，该次的全部伤害都会被吸收。", "description_en": "Templar Assassin becomes highly elusive, gaining a small barrier and bonus to her damage.  The damage and avoidance effects are separate, and have a limited number of instances. If a barrier is consumed, a new one is created as long as there are charges left. If an instance of damage would deal more damage than the remaining barrier, all of the damage is absorbed.", "notes_zh": ["生命移除类伤害将无视折光（也不会减少折光次数）。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "攻击力加成提升。被控制时可以施放折光。", "en": "Increases bonus damage. Refraction can be cast while disabled."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["instances", "shield_per_instance", "bonus_damage", "bonus_damage_per_instance_burn", "duration", "cast_while_disabled", "dispels", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "templar_assassin_meld", "name_zh": "圣堂刺客·隐匿", "name_en": "Meld", "description_zh": "圣堂刺客将自己隐藏起来，只要静止不动将一直处于隐身状态。只要在隐匿状态下攻击敌人打破隐身，拉娜娅的攻击将对敌人造成额外伤害，并降低其护甲，持续%debuff_duration%秒。额外伤害和隐匿的负面效果会施加给灵能之刃飞溅距离内所有敌人。", "description_en": "Templar Assassin conceals herself, becoming invisible as long as she remains still. If Meld's invisibility is broken by attacking an enemy, Lanaya's attack will deal bonus damage to the enemy and reduce their armor for %debuff_duration% seconds. Bonus damage and debuffs from Meld are applied to all enemies in the Psi Blades split range.", "notes_zh": ["除了停留在原地或持续施放灵能投射，其他任何动作都会打破隐匿效果。", "隐匿的护甲降低作用对防御塔无效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_damage", "bonus_armor", "bash_duration", "attack_range_bonus", "debuff_duration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "templar_assassin_psi_blades", "name_zh": "圣堂刺客·灵能之刃", "name_en": "Psi Blades", "description_zh": "圣堂刺客锋利的灵能之刃可以穿透敌人，对其正后方的敌方单位造成伤害，并且攻击距离得到提升。每对一个单位造成伤害后，飞溅伤害都会减少一定百分比。", "description_en": "Templar Assassin's psi blades slice through the attacked unit, splitting and damaging enemy units directly behind it, while gaining bonus attack range. For each unit it damages, the split damage is reduced by a percentage.", "notes_zh": ["飞溅伤害可以伤害隐身单位。", "重击等攻击特效只对主目标有效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_attack_range", "attack_spill_range", "attack_spill_width", "attack_spill_pct", "meld_strike_spills"]}, {"subject": "templar_assassin_trap_teleport", "name_zh": "圣堂刺客·灵能投射", "name_en": "Psionic Projection", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 圣堂刺客经过%abilitychanneltime%秒持续施法后可以传送至任意灵能陷阱，到达时引爆灵能陷阱，陷阱总是最大效果，并且立刻造成%extra_damage%点额外伤害。灵能投射在持续施法时不会脱离隐匿效果。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Allows Templar Assassin to teleport to any Psionic Trap after channeling for %abilitychanneltime% seconds, detonating it upon arrival as if it was fully charged and instantly dealing %extra_damage% bonus damage. Channeling Psionic Projection does not break Meld.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["extra_damage", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "templar_assassin_psionic_trap", "name_zh": "圣堂刺客·灵能陷阱", "name_en": "Psionic Trap", "description_zh": "圣堂刺客放下一个隐形的神秘陷阱监视敌人的动向。引爆后将减缓%trap_radius%范围内敌人的移动速度，陷阱放置时间越久，引爆后减速效果越强，最低为%movement_speed_min%%%，放置%trap_max_charge_duration%秒后引爆将达到最大减速效果，为%movement_speed_max%%%，并且还能造成额外伤害。", "description_en": "Templar Assassin places mystical traps that invisibly monitor enemy movement. When sprung at her command, they exert a slowing influence of %movement_speed_min%%% in a %trap_radius% radius. Trap movement slow charges up to %movement_speed_max%%% after %trap_max_charge_duration% seconds. Deals damage after %trap_max_charge_duration%s.", "notes_zh": ["陷阱没有时间限制。", "他们拥有隐形效果，渐隐时间为%trap_fade_time%秒，还拥有技能免疫状态。他们可以承受2次远程英雄的攻击，1次近战英雄的攻击，或4次非英雄单位的攻击。", "陷阱的视野是250/250，不能阻止中立生物刷新。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "现在陷阱引爆后还会沉默受到作用的敌人。", "en": "When activated, traps now silence affected enemies."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["trap_radius", "trap_duration", "max_traps", "trap_fade_time", "movement_speed_min", "movement_speed_max", "trap_bonus_damage", "extra_damage", "damage_tick_rate", "trap_max_charge_duration", "min_silence_duration", "max_silence_duration", "bonus_vision", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint"]}, {"subject": "templar_assassin_inner_peace", "name_zh": "圣堂刺客·心怀安宁", "name_en": "Inner Peace", "description_zh": "原地不动且未受到伤害超过%time_until_meditation%秒后，圣堂刺客开始冥想，获得生命恢复和魔法恢复加成，冥想%time_until_max_bonus%秒后达到最大加成。", "description_en": "When remaining stationary and not taking damage for %time_until_meditation%s, Templar Assassin begins meditating, gaining health and mana regeneration, reaching the maximum bonus after %time_until_max_bonus%s of meditating.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["max_hp_regen", "max_mana_regen", "time_until_meditation", "time_until_max_bonus"]}, {"subject": "viper_poison_attack", "name_zh": "冥界亚龙·毒性攻击", "name_en": "Poison Attack", "description_zh": "蝮蛇的毒液得到强化，使他的普通攻击附带效果，可以降低目标的移动速度和魔法抗性，并持续造成伤害。效果可以叠加，最多叠加%max_stacks%次。", "description_en": "Intensifies Viper's venom, adding an effect to his normal attack that applies a stacking movement speed slow and magic resistance deduction while dealing damage over time. Stacks up to %max_stacks% times.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "提升最大叠加次数，毒性攻击可以降低护甲，并且可以作用于建筑，造成的伤害有所降低。", "en": "Increases max stacks, and causes Poison Attack to lower armor per stack and to affect buildings for reduced damage."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "damage", "movement_speed", "magic_resistance", "max_stacks", "bonus_range", "shard_armor_reduction", "shard_building_dmg_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost"]}, {"subject": "viper_nethertoxin", "name_zh": "冥界亚龙·幽冥剧毒", "name_en": "Nethertoxin", "description_zh": "蝮蛇向目标区域释放幽冥剧毒。范围内的单位持续受到伤害，在区域内停留的时间越长，受到的伤害也越高。同时他们的攻击速度会被降低。", "description_en": "Viper releases a Nethertoxin at the targeted area. Units in that area take an increasing damage over time based on how long they remain in it. Units in it have their attack speed slowed.", "notes_zh": ["多个幽冥剧毒不会叠加。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["min_damage", "max_damage", "max_duration", "radius", "attack_slow", "duration", "projectile_speed", "radius_increase", "expand_interval", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "viper_corrosive_skin", "name_zh": "冥界亚龙·腐蚀皮肤", "name_en": "Corrosive Skin", "description_zh": "蝮蛇分泌出感染性的毒素，%max_range%范围内任何伤害它的敌人都将受到伤害，同时攻击速度也被降低。这种酸性分泌物还能提高蝮蛇的魔法抗性。", "description_en": "Viper exudes an infectious toxin that damages and slows the attack speed of any enemy that damages it in a %max_range% radius. The acid exudate also increases Viper's resistance to magic.", "notes_zh": ["与其他提升魔法抗性的物品和技能叠加。", "破坏会使腐蚀皮肤不再施加效果。极恶俯冲还是会施加腐蚀皮肤。", "这个技能造成的伤害被视为反弹伤害。反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "腐蚀皮肤会对距离冥界亚龙%effect_multiplier_distance%范围内的敌人施加%effect_multiplier%倍攻击速度降低效果。当冥界亚龙处于幽冥剧毒中，腐蚀皮肤的魔法抗性和每秒伤害会逐渐提升，在%nethertoxin_bonus_pct_max_duration_tooltip%秒后，达到最高的%nethertoxin_bonus_pct%%%提升。", "en": "Corrosive Skin applies %effect_multiplier%x the attack speed slow to enemies that are within %effect_multiplier_distance% distance of Viper.  Viper's Corrosive Skin Magic Resistance and Damage per Second are gradually increased while he is in Nethertoxin, up to %nethertoxin_bonus_pct%%% increased effect after %nethertoxin_bonus_pct_max_duration_tooltip%s."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["duration", "bonus_attack_speed", "bonus_magic_resistance", "damage", "max_range", "effect_multiplier_distance", "effect_multiplier", "nethertoxin_bonus_pct", "nethertoxin_bonus_pct_max_duration_tooltip"]}]
